{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284410","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1028441001:0":{"text":"We've brought the gleamtails!","source_cn":"荧尾鼠，我们带回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF152E8E9AE8C6FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028441002:0":{"text":"Let me see... Oh, look at these cuties. Don't worry, you're not in danger. You're just here to teach the children about nature…","source_cn":"我看看……哎呀，好可爱的小家伙。放心吧，它们不会有危险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA76D209103C7A13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028441003:0":{"text":"Hmm... Ah, this isn't right...","source_cn":"嗯，果然……还是不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D2C9D00ACE8D63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028441003":{"text":"Hmm... Ah, this isn't right...","source_cn":"嗯，果然……还是不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65D2C9D00ACE8D63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028441004:0":{"text":"How could I've made a mistake? These guys are gleamtails!","source_cn":"我怎么可能会认错，就是这些家伙没错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D683DF8C0B842F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028441005:0":{"text":"Yes, they are gleamtails, but...<style=\"highlight\">these two are both male</style>.","source_cn":"不不，物种非常正确，但是……你们找回来的<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34BDFF6EF3C0A347","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028441005":{"text":"Yes, they are gleamtails, but...<style=\"highlight\">these two are both male</style>.","source_cn":"不不，物种非常正确，但是……你们找回来的<style=highlight>这两只，都是雄性</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34BDFF6EF3C0A347","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028441006:0":{"text":"Good question, my teaching assistant. Please pay attention to the following details!","source_cn":"问得好，助教<male>先生</male><femal...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x89A8789EF5298C10","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Good question, my teaching assistant. Please pay attention to the following details!","female":"Good question, my teaching assistant. Please pay attention to the following details!","variant_male_record_index":"111928","variant_female_record_index":"111929","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028441007:0":{"text":"There is a hidden gland in the gleamtail's tail. After digesting the wisteria vine, the male will release an aroma that smells like the butterfly orchid to attract females.","source_cn":"你们看，荧尾鼠尾部生有一个隐蔽的腺体，消化过紫豆藤，雄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x620EAB5714441509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028441008:0":{"text":"Put your nose close to their rear end, at the base of the tail, and take a deep breath, you can smell...","source_cn":"像这样把鼻子凑近它们的臀部，尤其是尾巴根部的排泄道附近...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x240E5A78BACF2B8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028441009:0":{"text":"EWWWWWWW!!!","source_cn":"——不不不不不不不！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8515D553ED19105D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028441010:0":{"text":"I WILL NEVER SMELL A GLEAMTAIL'S BUTT! What kind of evil lesson is this?","source_cn":"我！才不要！去闻荧尾鼠的屁股！！这是什么恶魔的课程？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9079A6080C3DD035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028441011:0":{"text":"I think this is great practical knowledge, and it will leave a lasting impression on students.","source_cn":"是精确又能给学生留下深刻印象的基础实践，仓鼠小姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71AD09824BB5578D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028441012:0":{"text":"See! The teachers at Jade Lake Academy aren't normal!","source_cn":"看吧，我就说！和翡湖学院的老师扯上关系一定没好事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66350D44C9477692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1028441012":{"text":"See! The teachers at Jade Lake Academy aren't normal!","source_cn":"看吧，我就说！和翡湖学院的老师扯上关系一定没好事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66350D44C9477692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028441013:0":{"text":"If this creature isn't suitable, either... I have one last backup plan.","source_cn":"唔，这种方式也不行吗……那就只能采用最后的计划了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54240D40B734CAD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028441014:0":{"text":"Teaching with deer. It's a safe and reliable choice, but a bit unimaginative if you ask me.","source_cn":"非常稳妥，但毫无创新性的教学计划：用牡鹿和牝鹿来教学。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDB3F3F52ECA6FEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028441015:0":{"text":"There are a lot of deer in this forest. The stags have antlers and the does don't. You can tell them apart at a glance.","source_cn":"这片丛林的牡鹿有角，牝鹿无角，一眼就可以分辨出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4274F2D0F70A1129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1028441015":{"text":"There are a lot of deer in this forest. The stags have antlers and the does don't. You can tell them apart at a glance.","source_cn":"这片丛林的牡鹿有角，牝鹿无角，一眼就可以分辨出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4274F2D0F70A1129","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1028441016:0":{"text":"Yes! But I can't always leave the lesson preparation to my teaching assistants. After all, I'm the one who will be giving the lesson.","source_cn":"是的！但是也不能总是把备课工作交给助教，毕竟我才是最后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E7FC6047C049082","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1028441017:0":{"text":"It's not long before classes start, so it'll be faster if we look for them separately. Here, take this.","source_cn":"距离开课时间不久了，分头去找效率更高——请拿着这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C76FA0D04909A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1028441018:0":{"text":"This is an <style=\"highlight\">antler flute</style>, which is commonly used in Vaduso. The sounds it emits are similar to the calls of a deer. This will attract them to you.","source_cn":"这是瓦度索常用的<style=highlight>鹿笛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB0BDCEB37AA96EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1028441019:0":{"text":"There are many deer around him. Find them and guide them to this cabin.","source_cn":"这附近就栖息着牡鹿和牝鹿，如果找到了，就把它们引到这座...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0AA8C4FED10E6CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:23:0:1":{"text":"So next, we're going to find a deer?","source_cn":"所以接下来，我们要去找鹿？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC21F383A71578142","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So next, we're going to find a deer?","female":"So next, we're going to find a deer?","variant_male_record_index":"61466","variant_female_record_index":"61467","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"How about a different animal?","source_cn":"或者，换一种教学动物？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x994D14F25DB94FBA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How about a different animal?","female":"How about a different animal?","variant_male_record_index":"61460","variant_female_record_index":"61461","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"Are students required to do this?","source_cn":"……一定要让学生实践这个？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4B64AE7D2BF9A902","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are students required to do this?","female":"Are students required to do this?","variant_male_record_index":"61462","variant_female_record_index":"61463","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:2:3":{"text":"Jade Lake Academy is eye-opening.","source_cn":"翡湖学院的教学真让人大开眼界","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x38F571F37B575305","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Jade Lake Academy is eye-opening.","female":"Jade Lake Academy is eye-opening.","variant_male_record_index":"61464","variant_female_record_index":"61465","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"What's the difference in appearance?","source_cn":"外观上有什么区别？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCBAD6C68521D94A7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's the difference in appearance?","female":"What's the difference in appearance?","variant_male_record_index":"61456","variant_female_record_index":"61457","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"How can you tell?","source_cn":"到底是怎么分辨的？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5C8B27C45A8D2DF2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How can you tell?","female":"How can you tell?","variant_male_record_index":"61458","variant_female_record_index":"61459","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"What's wrong?","source_cn":"哪里不对？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8A941D28E67BA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's wrong?","female":"What's wrong?","variant_male_record_index":"61452","variant_female_record_index":"61453","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"Are these not gleamtails?","source_cn":"难道这不是荧尾鼠？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA98B2664021D6F1B"